  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/720/223/goldenhopper_banner.png\" width=\"1100\" height=\"270\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/502/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"Forge\" width=\"99\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/503/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"105\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/501/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mrcrayfish.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/500/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的網站\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/MrCrayfishMinecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/499/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的 YouTube\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/336389026586165261?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=cc923d&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=ffffff\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的 Discord\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>📖 關於：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">黃金漏斗是一個非常簡單的模組，如其名，它加入了黃金漏斗！它們就像普通的漏斗一樣，但你可以過濾哪些物品可以被拉取和推送。它試圖模仿經典的紅石漏斗過濾設計，只允許過濾一個物品，而且你必須使用其中一個物品作為濾材，而不僅僅是參考。這個模組刻意保持簡單，以維持原版遊戲的風格。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>🔨 合成方式：</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5T8VaXg.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"206\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ch692Bv.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"206\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>📷 截圖：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mY48udw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hieW4Tw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5oofACO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>🙋‍♀️ <strong>需要支援？加入官方 Discord 伺服器：</strong></p><p>留言區不太適合尋求支援，請加入官方 Discord 伺服器。您可以獲得安裝與設定模組、解決崩潰問題等協助！此外，您還能搶先獲得模組更新與開發消息。</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/794/808/img.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"195\" height=\"28\"></a></p>",
